#: src/postulo/templates/cotton/identifier_schemes.html
msgid "<code dir=\"ltr\">iso7064-mod11-2</code>, which an ORCID ends in, or <code dir=\"ltr\">iso7064-mod97-10</code>, which a legal-entity identifier ends in. No other can be named."
msgstr "<code dir=\"ltr\">iso7064-mod11-2</code>（ORCID 結尾所用），或 <code dir=\"ltr\">iso7064-mod97-10</code>（法人機構識別碼結尾所用）。不能指定其他名稱。"

