#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: a person may have a picture of the whole page kept, sent by their browser extension or drawn here from the kept source with scripts and the network off. A picture taken in somebody's browser shows the page as they were seeing it, signed in or not. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep one."
msgstr "是：使用者可以保留整個頁面的圖片，由其瀏覽器擴充功能傳送，或在此處停用指令碼與網路後，從保留的原始碼繪製。在某人瀏覽器中擷取的圖片，會呈現此人當時看到的頁面，無論是否已登入。否或未設定：任何人的擷取項目都不會保留圖片。"

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: a person may have the page's source kept beside what was read from it, exactly as it was parsed, so that a capture can be checked against it and read again by a better parser. It is kept as text and never shown as a page. No, or not set: nobody's captures keep it, whatever they have chosen."
msgstr "是：使用者可以將頁面的原始碼與從中讀取的內容一起保留，與剖析時完全相同，以便將擷取項目與其核對，並日後以更好的剖析器重新讀取。原始碼以文字形式保留，絕不會以頁面形式顯示。否或未設定：無論使用者如何選擇，任何人的擷取項目都不會保留原始碼。"

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: anyone who finds the address may create an account. No: invitation only. An empty instance always offers the sign-up form, so somebody can become the first account."
msgstr "是：任何找到此網址的人都可以建立帳號。否：僅限受邀。沒有任何帳號的站台一律會提供註冊表單，讓某人成為第一個帳號。"

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr "是：透過身分識別提供者前來的人會直接登入，不會再要求輸入代碼。只有在您確知該提供者核驗身分至少和 Postulo 一樣嚴謹時，才選擇「是」。這絕不適用於密碼登入，也不會移除任何人的驗證器應用程式。通行金鑰本身就已足夠，不需要此設定。"

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "Yes: somebody who has forgotten their password can ask for a code at their primary address and type it back. A code rather than a link, because mail scanners follow links and would spend one before the person read it. It is never a second factor: an authenticator app is still asked for. Offered only while this instance's mail is actually getting through."
msgstr "是：忘記密碼的人可以要求將代碼寄到其主要電子郵件地址，再輸入該代碼。之所以用代碼而非連結，是因為郵件掃描程式會開啟連結，可能在本人讀到之前就把它用掉。這絕不是第二重驗證：仍會要求驗證器應用程式。只有在此站台的郵件確實能寄達時才會提供。"

